  "description": "Vault into the vivid world of graffiti-inspired typography with the “King Jack Style”. It’s a dynamic, 3D layered font that infuses your designs with an assertive and attention-grabbing aesthetic. Every letter carries three distinctive layers: standard, internal, and shadow – put together to introduce a striking depth, giving your text a lifelike profile that virtually leaps off the screen. \n“King Jack Style” is an ideal fit for street-style themes, mural-inspired designs, bold posters, dazzling album covers, or any creative endeavor requiring a potent and lively typographic influence. Assert your message with verve and panache, courtesy of this distinctive font. Delve into the limitless potential of “King Jack Style”, as it lends an undeniable urban edge and cultivated artistic elegance to your work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Vault into the vivid world of graffiti-inspired typography with the “King Jack Style”. It’s a dynamic, 3D layered font that infuses your designs with an assertive and attention-grabbing aesthetic. Every letter carries three distinctive layers: standard, internal, and shadow – put together to introduce a striking depth, giving your text a lifelike profile that virtually leaps off the screen. </p>\n<p>“King Jack Style” is an ideal fit for street-style themes, mural-inspired designs, bold posters, dazzling album covers, or any creative endeavor requiring a potent and lively typographic influence. Assert your message with verve and panache, courtesy of this distinctive font. Delve into the limitless potential of “King Jack Style”, as it lends an undeniable urban edge and cultivated artistic elegance to your work.</p>",
